    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***SECURE UNDERGROUND PARKING | COURTYARD SETTING | PRIME DUBLIN CITY LOCATION***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are delighted to present 10 Kingsmill Court, a spacious one-bedroom apartment ideally positioned in the heart of Dublin City. Combining a generous interior layout with the added benefit of secure underground parking, this property offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking a city-centre home or investment.\r\n\r\nLocated within the well-established Kingsmill Court development, the apartment enjoys a pleasant courtyard-facing aspect, creating a sense of privacy and calm despite its highly central location. The property benefits from its own private entrance and a well-considered layout, with bright, generously sized accommodation throughout.\r\n\r\nOn entering, the welcoming hallway leads into the main living accommodation, comprising a well-proportioned open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. This versatile space is ideal for both relaxing and entertaining, with the kitchen seamlessly integrated into the living environment. The apartment also features a particularly spacious double bedroom, while the accommodation is completed by a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe location is one of the property's key attractions. Kingsmill Court is within easy walking distance of an extensive range of shops, cafés, restaurants and city-centre amenities, with The Ilac Centre, Henry Street, Capel Street and O'Connell Street all close by. Dublin's cultural and social attractions are also readily accessible, with Temple Bar and Smithfield just a short stroll away.\r\n\r\nExcellent public transport connections further enhance the appeal of this property. The Green Luas line at Dominick Street is only minutes away, while numerous Dublin Bus routes are available close by, providing convenient access throughout the city and beyond.\r\n\r\nWith its generous proportions, secure parking and exceptionally convenient city-centre setting, 10 Kingsmill Court represents an attractive opportunity in one of Dublin's most accessible locations.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
